{"unit_id":"mokuyoaxis__agent-guard#card-zh","repo":"mokuyoaxis/agent-guard","commit":"7431da176bfea6e420bea4ee01cdefba760b5e8c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Guard 是面向 DSH 的插件，为 Bash 删除类操作提供执行前检查，并把共享 Python Core 的判决接入 DSH 的工具前置事件。它注册安全删除、恢复和状态查询三个模型工具，也可向系统提示加入操作指引。主要能力包括：为支持的删除操作保留可恢复数据、为部分 Git 覆盖操作保存快照、列出和恢复隔离事务，以及查看适配器状态与清理信息；还提供需显式启用的文本读取结果脱敏扩展。适合希望在 DSH 工作区中管理删除和恢复流程的编码 Agent 使用。运行 Core 需要 Python 3.9+ 与 Git；可选读取扩展需要显式配置本地 DSH 包路径和工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/lib/index.js:343-445","adapters/dsh/lib/index.js:542-596","adapters/dsh/lib/read_result_guard.js:170-205"]}
{"unit_id":"mokuyoaxis__agent-guard#card-en","repo":"mokuyoaxis/agent-guard","commit":"7431da176bfea6e420bea4ee01cdefba760b5e8c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Agent Guard connects DSH's pre-execution event to a Python Core for supported Bash deletion checks. It adds tools to delete, restore transactions and view status, plus prompt guidance. An optional extension scans native text-read results. The Core needs Python 3.9+ and Git.","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/lib/index.js:343-445","adapters/dsh/lib/index.js:542-620","adapters/dsh/lib/read_result_guard.js:170-205"]}
